WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.960
Welcome to MediBin Hero.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.470
Hospital waste is sorted into four colour-coded bins.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.950
Let's see what goes into each one.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.740
The yellow bin is for infectious waste.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.570
Body parts removed in surgery, and placenta.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.120
Plaster of Paris casts.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.960
Used cotton.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.340
Dressing materials and bandages.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.230
Bedding, paper and cloth stained with blood or body fluids.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.840
Face masks and caps.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:36.150
Cytotoxic, expired and discarded medicines.

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.470
And pathological and laboratory waste.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.970
The red bin is for contaminated plastic.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.830
Syringes, without the needle.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.700
Gloves and IV bottles.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.390
All blood collection tubes.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.700
ESR tubes.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.650
VIDAS strips.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.400
And rapid test cards.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.540
The blue bin is for glass and metal.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.200
Broken glass.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.220
Ampoules and glass vials.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.300
Lab slides.

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.300
Nails.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.460
Metallic body implants.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.290
And scissors.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.910
The green bin is for general waste.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.250
General waste, like paper, boxes and cartons.

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.640
Leftover food.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.680
Stationery.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.040
Paper cups.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.610
And kitchen waste.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:40.410
Yellow: infectious waste.

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:42.830
Red: contaminated plastic.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.900
Blue: glass and metal.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.150
Green: general waste.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.440
Right waste, right bin, every time.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.950
Now play MediBin Hero, and test yourself.
